55:38.360 --> 55:40.120
I'll leave you with this provocative thought.

55:40.780 --> 55:44.620
What if the future of film has no final audio mix at all?

55:44.780 --> 55:45.880
A radical idea.

55:45.880 --> 55:52.080
What if, a decade from now, films are not delivered as static, locked, two-channel files, but as

55:52.080 --> 55:53.880
