55:54.680 --> 56:00.060
Imagine audio tracks that constantly and visibly monitor the acoustic limitations of your specific

56:00.060 --> 56:00.520
living room.

56:00.600 --> 56:01.700
They adapt to your space.

56:01.980 --> 56:03.420
They know you have a cheap soundbar.

56:03.500 --> 56:04.480
They know you live in an apartment.

56:04.880 --> 56:09.500
And they automatically remix themselves second by second to guarantee your perfect personal

56:09.500 --> 56:11.100
