56:18.800 --> 56:20.040
That would be a beautiful thing.

56:20.300 --> 56:22.840
That is a future I desperately want to listen to.

56:23.280 --> 56:28.000
Think about your own acoustic occupation tonight, the next time you pick up that remote.

56:28.480 --> 56:30.280
Thanks for taking the deep dive with us.

